/.quarto/
/_site
.Rproj.user/
.Rhistory
.RData
.DS_Store
/.luarc.json

**/*.quarto_ipynb
/dist/
# Quarto's per-page figure directories from a local render; the site's copies live in _site
**/*_files/
/.venv/

# Workshop data ships with the materials. A maintainer's global gitignore may exclude
# spreadsheets and SPSS files, which would leave them out of the release zips.
!**/dataSets/**/*.xlsx
!**/dataSets/**/*.xls
!**/dataSets/**/*.sav

# Working notes kept on the maintainer's machine, never committed
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
STATUS.md
TASKS.md

# Quarto writes this at the repository root when a single page is rendered while
# the output directory is a symlink outside the repository. Build artefact, never ours.
site_libs/
